1 NAME Brita /Jonsdotter Buschera/
2 GIVN Brita
2 SURN Jonsdotter Buschera
1 SEX F
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Att NN är dotter till Jonas Buscherus framgår av inlägg i Anbytarforum: http://forum.genealogi.se/index.php?topic=38621.msg589562#msg589562
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT The Goldsmith Anders Mattson Diurman was married to [Brita Jonsdotter Buschera,] a sister of the vicar in Skellefteå Nicolaus Buscherus (1645-1703) and thus the daughter of the vicar in Umeå Jonas Nicolai Buscherus. [Jonas] died 1
2 CONC 657 in Umeå (concluded from Uleåborgs rådstugurätts dombok för år 1706 regarding a young boy, Jonas Andersson, from Kråken).
2 CONT
2 CONT Anders' wife is sometimes confused in genealogies with her cousin Elisabet Jonsdotter Grubb, wife of Jacob Hansson Fällman.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Kråken 24 database, https://kråken.se/ person 185570 has birth ca. 1650
2 CONT Family Boströms, https://familjenbostrom.se/genealogi/bure/olof/11-44414.htm
2 CONT Discussion about the wife of Anders Mattson Diurman at Anbytarforum, https://forum.rotter.se/index.php?topic=38621.msg589563
