1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Master goldsmith (guldsmedsmästaren) in Vaasa,  Österbotten (present day Finland), 1701. He lived in Jakobstad, Österbotten, 1678-1696, then Vaasa, 1700-1706. He married about 1678, according to the tax rolls (Mant
2 CONC alslängder), and died about 1709.
2 CONT
