1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Was innkeeper/restaurantuer (Gastgivare) in Rickleå 13. When he dies, his son, our ancestor, Johan Klingstrom Andersson, inherits his business.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dombok (Court Judgment Book) mentioning Anders' inheritance, and Anders' son Johan:
2 CONT Dmb 1737 vt [Spring] Gl Johan Kraft to his deceased brother-in-law Anders Olofsson in Rikleå left ½ the homestead in Rikleå 4 skl. to Anders Olofsson's son Johan, Kraft's wife's nephew, and to trigger his brother Nils Klingström, 
2 CONC county magistrate, DII:1, p. 10.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Agneta Olofsson, "Bygdeå Byar och Gårdar," (2006) p. 355, Edfastmark 3 (son), & p. 336 Rikleå 13; Dombok entries.
2 CONT Kråken 24 database, https://kråken.se/ person 144112 gives source "KA" (Kurt Andersson) for birth and death, but I can't find Anders in Kurt's qhurth.com website.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Source ===
