1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Allan Anderson notes:
2 CONT ff mm mf  mm; my 6th great grandma.
2 CONT
2 CONT Per Erik Nils Holmlund: Sigrid Persdotter Flark. Mattias' widow was in Prästbordet, Skellefteå lfs. from 1717 to 1720, in Umeå stad from 1728 to 1734, then in Mjödvatnet, Burträsk, 1740.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dombok (Court judgment book) 1716: Skellefteå lfs: Sigrid Flarck's husband is Mathias Diurman.
2 CONT Church account, 1725 11/6: Borgaren Diurman's widow donated 3 dalers. 
2 CONT Death and burial book for Burträsk parish, 1750-03-04: wife Sigrid Djurman died at age 68.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sigrid is mentioned as a sister of burgher Anders Persson Flark, and that Sigrid later lived at Kyrkobordet and married lvice länsman (deputy sheriff) Mattias Djurman (Lundström, p. 488).
2 CONT
2 CONT From Lundström, p. 761: "[Her husband] Mattias Djurman died in 1716-17 and his widow was at Kyrkobordet in 1717-20. She then moved to Burträsk parish, where she died in 1750. The couple had previously lived in Burträsk parish."
2 CONT
2 CONT At Mjödvattnet Burträsk (from Agneta Olofsson, p. 214): "AI:1 del2
2 CONT Sigrid Flarck 1682 Umeå Stad – 1750 4/3 Umeå Stad (gift guldsmed Anders[son] Djurman, Umeå Stad)
2 CONT Margareta [17]10, Åbyn 10
2 CONT Karin [17]12 1/9 Umeå Stad, Åbyn inhyses
2 CONT Krskp [church accounts] 1725 11/6: Borgaren Djurman's änka förärat (widow honored), 3d"
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Burial record, Burträsks kyrkoarkiv, Födelse- och dopböcker, SE/HLA/1010024/C/1 (1740-1759), https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/C0033987_00168
2 CONT Ulf Lundström, "Skellefteå socken 1650-1790," pp. 24 (Mjödvattnet Inhyses),166,   https://lokalhistoriaskelleftea.se/pdf/B%C3%B6nder%20och%20g%C3%A5rdar%20i%20Skellefte%C3%A5%20socken%201650-1790.pdf
2 CONT Kråken 24 database, https://kråken.se/ person 185572 gives "SB" as birth source, b. ca. 1670.
2 CONT
