1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Noteringar Fältväbel Olof Olofsson Huss f 1731-04-25 i Brunflo. Anställd vid Majorens komp. och Jämtlands dragonregemente 1770-1780.Tog avsked , arb, som assistent åt en lantmätare en tid, blev sedan nybyggare. Var 1783 i Galajök,
2 CONC  Dals sn, Ångermanl. 1785 i Sollefteå , 1787 i Edsele. Död 1799 i Brudbäcken, . Gift 1770-09-20 med Elisabet Fredrika Lemoine f. 1752-08-18 i Eltnäs, Berg. Källa Ulla Nordenstam, 2003 226. Olof Olofsson [Huss]
2 CONT * 1731-04-25, Lund, Brunflo, Jämtland (Z) † 1799 (approximately), Brudbäcken, Edsele, Ångermanland (Y) H: Olof Olofsson (Huss) was a nybyggare (settler) and a fältväbe1 at the Major's company and Jämtland's dragoon regiment from 1
2 CONC 770 to 1780-06-12 when he resigned from Jämtland's riflemen regiment. During the first years after his resignation he worked as an assistant for a land surveyor. He lived with Elisabeth Fredrika Lemoine for some time at her parent
2 CONC s' farm in the village Galagök in Dal parish, Ångermanland (Y), and they then became settlers. In 1785 the family moved to Sollefteå (Y) and two years later they lived in Brudbäcken, Edsele, Ångermanland (Y). They were not registe
2 CONC red in Brudbäcken in the parish catechism record for 1807-1816. S: O.C. Ahlström (1890) Norrländska slägter: Genealogiska och biografiska anteckningar, vol 1, pp.38-39 (Östersund); Ulla Nordenstam, 2003 http://www.havsnas.se/anor/
2 CONC p662006fa.html
