1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Karin marries (1) Anders Olson. Gastgivare (innkeeper) at Rickleå 13. After Anders Olson dies, his widow Karin marries (2) Pehr Olofsson. Also a second marriage for widower Per Olofsson, after Brita Olofsdotter die
2 CONC s. Their marriage record: Karin Nilsdotter, Widow (Ånka), Rickleå, on 1750-04-26 with Pehr Olofsson, Widower (Änkling), Bäck. His first wife, Brita, was sister to my 5th great grandma, Karin O.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dombok (Court Judgment Book) entry, where she and her sons are mentioned:
2 CONT Dmb 1748 vt [Spring]: Nils Andersson Klingström in Skinnarbyn against his brother Johan Andersson Klingström in Rikleå agreed case, concerning which the innkeeper after the birth mother Karin Nilsdotter was not allowed to draw up 
2 CONC a legal inventory.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Agneta Olofsson, "Bygdeå Byar och Gårdar," p.  294, Rikleå 13 continued.
2 CONT Kråken 24 database, https://kråken.se/ person 144999 gives source "KA" (Kurt Andersson) for birth, but I can't find her.
2 CONT
