1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elisabet wed Johan  Kingstrom-Anderson, whose Aunt Karin O. was my 5th great grandma, Karin O.
2 CONT Shown as wife of Johan Klingstrom A. + kids at Rickleå #13  A1:2.48 (1746-62).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lövånger marriage book: 15 Nov 1738 vigdes Gästgivaren ifrån Rickleå Johan Andersson Klingström med pigan Elisabet Andersdotter Fattenborg i Kräkånger. Shown with parents at Lövånger, A1:2.37 (1712-29).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lisa Fattenborg loses her husband Johan at age 36 on Christmas Eve, 1749.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dombok (Court Judgment Book) entries, after Elizabet's husband Johan died:
2 CONT Dmb1750vt: guardian for minor children of guest Johan Andersson in Rikleå, the children's debtors Matts Nisson in Rikleå, Hans Zackrisson in Edfastmark and guest Anders Andersson in Djäkneboda were appointed.
2 CONT Dmb 1753 /10: guest widow E. Fattenborg from Rikleå complained about the fact that the guardian of her and her underage children.. adopted Zackris Persson as a country resident, he who now over the year lived in half the homestead
2 CONC ...
2 CONT
2 CONT Lisa in death register, 1788: widow of innkeeper John Kingstrom-Anderson dies at age 70; cause of death: asthma and stomach pain (Andtappa & Megflen).
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Agneta Olofsson, "Bygdeå Byar och Gårdar," p. 336-337, Rikleå 13 continued (cites DII:1.48v).
2 CONT Kråken 13 person 142380, https://kråken.se/ gives source for birth & death as "SLJ;" HFL: Rickleå, Bygdeå widow on AI:4,3/3,p.116 (1771-86) and widow and death on AI:5b.268 (1784-89), b. 1728. But according to the födelsebok she w
2 CONC as born 1716-11-01.
2 CONT
